SUMMARY:You Can See Everything
LOCATION:Beacon Cinema\, 57 North St\, Pittsfield\, MA 01201
DESCRIPTION:Times: 6:20pm\, 8:25pm\, 9:45pm\nThirty-four days before she’
 s sent to prison\, notorious Silicon Valley founder Elizabeth Holmes invit
 es a skeptical film crew to document her every move. What begins as an int
 imate portrait of an enigmatic felon becomes a mind-bending three-year jou
 rney into the abyss. From boundary-pushing directors Nathan Fielder and La
 nce Oppenheim comes You Can See Everything.\nhttps://www.phoenixmovies.net
 /movies/you-can-see-everything/HO00001794\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: http
 s://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.phoenixmovies.net/movies/you-can-see-everything/HO00001794
END:VEVENT
